---
description: Managevent monorepo master rules (summary of root AGENTS.md)
alwaysApply: true
---
- Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root and the `AGENTS.md` in the folder you are editing before making changes. They are authoritative; this file only summarises them. The backlog is `ROADMAP.md`.
- pnpm 10 workspaces and Turborepo. TypeScript 5.9 strict. No `any`.
- Contracts: `packages/validators` (Zod) and `packages/db`. Never redefine shapes locally. Shared-package changes need the `contract-change` label.
- Web apps never import Prisma. All writes go through `apps/api`.
- Money: integer cents, AUD, GST only via `packages/payments`. Plan limits come from `packages/payments/src/plans.ts`.
- PII stays in Australia (one VPS in Sydney, ADR-0011). Never log PII, tokens, guest links or payment data. No secrets in code; local values go in the root `.env`, loaded only by `pnpm with-env`.
- Gate before finishing: `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test && pnpm build`. Prettier only on the files you changed.
- Only modify the paths named in the GitHub issue.
